{"category_id":"6a5dd80467bf62345b1ba73f","label_id":[],"sort":2,"status":1,"type":"content","details":"<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">恶劣工况之下，轴承失效极易引发整机停机，造成巨大生产损失。德国 GRONDE 格朗德建立完善的产品测试与品控体系，用层层测试剔除品质隐患。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">在产品研发与量产阶段，格朗德轴承需要通过多项极限工况考验：上万次疲劳极限测试模拟长期持续负载运行；高低温交变测试适配北方低温、厂区高温等复杂环境；重载冲击可靠性测试验证矿山、工程机械频繁冲击工况下的运行表现。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">量产完成后，每一件产品均不会跳过出厂检测流程。无损探伤排查内部材料缺陷；振动、噪音分级保障高速运转工况平稳；载荷测试核验额定承载性能，杜绝不合格产品流向市场。<\/p>\n<div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-language-override: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Noto Color Emoji'; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; flex: 0 1 auto; flex-direction: row; justify-content: normal; align-items: normal; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-image: none; background-position: 0% 0%; background-size: auto; background-repeat: repeat; background-attachment: scroll; background-origin: padding-box; background-clip: border-box; text-indent: 2em;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">依托德国 DIN 标准与系统化检测体系，GRONDE 格朗德产品广泛服务钢厂、煤矿、电厂等大型重工业企业，用稳定可靠的产品，减少设备突发故障，助力工业企业降本增效。<\/p>","bg_img":"https:\/\/oss.lcweb01.cn\/jzt\/6a5d900c3b7c8a0bdb25998e\/image\/20260813\/9ff8f364fe54b29dee9f80ebb676d710.jpeg","title":"全维度性能验证 GRONDE 格朗德轴承多重可靠性测试诠释德系严谨标准","column_id":"6a5dd7b35ef06b193f2b9a3a","site_id":"6a5d900c3b7c8a0bdb25998e","intro":"恶劣工况之下，轴承失效极易引发整机停机，造成巨大生产损失。德国 GRONDE 格朗德建立完善的产品测试与品控体系，用层层测试剔除品质隐患。","is_top":0,"create_time":"2026-07-23 10:29:59","update_time":"2026-08-13 18:26:31","readnum":0,"id":"6a617ca714326a1d2f6d6c70","gl_list":[]}